     suite - every other document is an eICR, so the whole RR half of the cda2fhir pipeline was untested. Structure
     modelled on samples/cda/RR-R1_1/RR-CDA-001_R1_1.xml, trimmed to the parts that carry regression risk.

     Covers:
       * the three RR agency LOC participants (Routing Entity 15.2.4.1, Responsible Agency 15.2.4.2, Rules Authoring
         Agency 15.2.4.3) -> rr-*-organization resources. These were silently dropped before 2026-07-29: as LOC
         participants carrying a participantRole they matched both Organization's and PractitionerRole's bundle-entry
         templates at equal priority, and the PractitionerRole path emits nothing without a person.
       * eICR Processing Status (15.2.3.29) with a Reason (15.2.3.21) and Reason Details (15.2.3.32). 15.2.3.32 maps
         to an Observation.component, and its absence from templates-to-suppress.xml produced dangling section-entry
         references.
       * Received eICR Information act (15.2.3.9) + eICR External Document Reference (15.2.3.10) -> DocumentReference.
       * Determination of reportability (15.2.3.19) with reason (.26) and rule (.27), reporting timeframe (.14),
         and an External Resources act (15.2.3.20). -->
